---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
lang: en
title: Do AI chatbots repeat Russian disinformation about Ukraine?
description: We test ChatGPT, Gemini, Grok, Claude, Copilot, Perplexity, DeepSeek and Le Chat for Russian disinformation about Ukraine, and report what we find.
breadcrumbTrail:
  - title: Home
    url: /
---
{% set copyEn = copy.en.index %}
{% set cycle = [
  { key: 'detect', label: 'Detect', nav: 'methodology' },
  { key: 'trace', label: 'Trace', nav: 'sources' },
  { key: 'publish', label: 'Publish', nav: 'registry' },
  { key: 'report', label: 'Report', nav: 'escalations' },
  { key: 'confirm', label: 'Confirm', nav: 'about' },
  { key: 're-measure', label: 'Re-measure', nav: 'reports' }
] %}
{% set trust = [
  { key: 'trust-method', nav: 'methodology', label: 'Methodology' },
  { key: 'trust-data', nav: 'data', label: 'Data' },
  { key: 'trust-actions', nav: 'escalations', label: 'Escalation log' },
  { key: 'trust-corrections', nav: 'corrections', label: 'Corrections' }
] %}
{% set latest = claims | default([]) %}

<h1>Do AI chatbots repeat Russian disinformation about Ukraine?</h1>

<p class="lede">Sometimes — and we measure exactly when. We test ChatGPT, Gemini, Grok, Claude, Copilot, Perplexity, DeepSeek and Le Chat with the questions people actually ask, record every time they repeat a known false claim, report it, and check whether it changes.</p>

{% if site.counters.claims %}
<ul class="counters">
  <li><b>{{ site.counters.claims }}</b><span>false {{ site.counters.claims | plural("claim", "claims") }} documented</span></li>
  <li><b>{{ site.counters.responses }}</b><span>chatbot {{ site.counters.responses | plural("answer", "answers") }} analysed</span></li>
  <li><b>{{ site.counters.escalations_sent }}</b><span>{{ site.counters.escalations_sent | plural("report", "reports") }} sent to platforms</span></li>
</ul>
{% endif %}
{% include "partials/updated.njk" %}

{% if navigation.has.registry or navigation.has.reports %}
<p class="actions">
  {% if navigation.has.registry %}<a href="{{ '/registry/' | url }}">Browse the registry</a>{% endif %}
  {% if navigation.has.reports %}<a href="{{ '/monitor/' | url }}">Read the latest report</a>{% endif %}
</p>
{% endif %}

<h2 id="the-problem">{{ copyEn.sections['the-audience-is-the-model'].title }}</h2>
{{ copyEn.sections['the-audience-is-the-model'].html | safe }}

<h2 id="what-we-do">{{ copyEn.sections['what-we-do'].title }}</h2>
{{ copyEn.sections['what-we-do'].html | safe }}

<ol class="cycle">
{% for step in cycle %}
  <li>
    <b>{{ loop.index }}. {{ step.label }}</b>
    {{ copyEn.sections[step.key].html | safe }}
    {% if navigation.byKey[step.nav] %}<p><a href="{{ navigation.byKey[step.nav].url | url }}">{{ navigation.byKey[step.nav].label }}</a></p>{% endif %}
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ol>
<p class="note">We report the change in repeat-rate before and after, per chatbot, and per persona.</p>

{% if latest | length %}
<h2 id="findings">What we have found so far</h2>
<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
  <caption>The five most recently updated claims. <a href="{{ '/registry/' | url }}">All claims</a>.</caption>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col">Claim</th><th scope="col">Verdict</th><th scope="col">Repeated by</th><th scope="col">Updated</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for claim in latest | take(5) %}
    <tr>
      <td><a href="{{ claim.url | url }}">{{ claim.title }}</a></td>
      <td><span class="badge badge-verdict badge-{{ claim.verdict }}">{{ claim.verdict | verdictLabel }}</span></td>
      <td>{{ claim.repeatedBy | length }} of 8</td>
      <td><time datetime="{{ claim.updated | isoDate }}">{{ claim.updated | displayDate }}</time></td>
    </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>
{% if navigation.has.escalations and site.counters.escalations_sent %}
<p>Escalations: {{ site.counters.escalations_sent }} report{{ "" if site.counters.escalations_sent == 1 else "s" }} sent · {{ site.counters.escalations_answered }} response{{ "" if site.counters.escalations_answered == 1 else "s" }} · {{ site.counters.escalations_actioned }} confirmed change{{ "" if site.counters.escalations_actioned == 1 else "s" }}. <a href="{{ '/escalations/' | url }}">See the escalation log</a></p>
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% if site.used_by | length %}
<h2 id="used-by">Where our data is used</h2>
<ul>
{% for item in site.used_by %}
  <li><a href="{{ item.url | url }}">{{ item.org }} — {{ item.title }}</a>, <time datetime="{{ item.date | isoDate }}">{{ item.date | displayDate }}</time></li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% endif %}

<h2 id="why-trust-this">Why trust this</h2>
<ul class="trust">
{% for item in trust %}
  <li>
    {{ copyEn.sections[item.key].html | safe }}
    {% if navigation.byKey[item.nav] %}<a href="{{ navigation.byKey[item.nav].url | url }}">{{ item.label }}</a>{% endif %}
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
{{ copyEn.sections['independence'].html | safe }}
{% if navigation.has.about %}<p><a href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">Who we are</a></p>{% endif %}
